%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Levels_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a02e01ee9c8597e479b3ddb25f58e717, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 72150890864889856
    m_Localized: The Lighthouse Keepers' Union
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889857
    m_Localized: one bulb
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889858
    m_Localized: The star bends space like any planet. Stellar mass is included in your licence.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889860
    m_Localized: Strait & Narrow Ltd.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889861
    m_Localized: a decommissioned school bus (unoccupied)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889862
    m_Localized: Shrink a world to widen the door. Residents are not notified.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889863
    m_Localized: Strait & Narrow are moving a school bus.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889864
    m_Localized: Madame Fink's Discount Gravity
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889865
    m_Localized: a piano
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889866
    m_Localized: Where you work is a decision. Our Space Corp does not reimburse home office expenses.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889868
    m_Localized: The Third Best Bakery
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889869
    m_Localized: a wedding cake, still warm
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889870
    m_Localized: Multi-zone enabled. Wrap only what you need. No liability for causality tears.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889871
    m_Localized: The Third Best Bakery paid extra for still warm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889872
    m_Localized: Nobody & Co.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889873
    m_Localized: a pre-paid 2038 funeral urn
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889874
    m_Localized: The field is free. The Wrap is not. Use existing gravity before someone privatizes it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889875
    m_Localized: Nobody & Co. prepaid this funeral in 2038.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889876
    m_Localized: The Inheritance of Mr. Fink
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889877
    m_Localized: the sector's final paper birth registry
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889878
    m_Localized: The manual was written for this one. Welcome, new employee. There is still no office.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164255
    m_Localized: That is every contract we have.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164254
    m_Localized: '> MORE CONTRACTS IN THE MAKING

      > PENDING AUDIT: DOES THE WRAP COST NOTHING?

      > REPLAY A JOB FOR 3 STARS'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164253
    m_Localized: Every ship draws on the same Wrap. Live cargo travels at its own existential risk.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164252
    m_Localized: The Very Small Opera
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164251
    m_Localized: the orchestra, one live animal
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164250
    m_Localized: Three ships. The budget did not grow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164249
    m_Localized: The opera starts without them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164247
    m_Localized: Fix the shared approach once. Our Space Corp values every customer. Both of them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164246
    m_Localized: The Last Two Customers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164245
    m_Localized: two halves of a gift
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164243
    m_Localized: The gift is still in pieces.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164242
    m_Localized: One door. Two deliveries.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164241
    m_Localized: 'One origin, two promises: bend near the start. Shared failures are billed twice.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164240
    m_Localized: Slightly Used Stars Ltd.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164239
    m_Localized: two secondhand fusion cores (slightly dimmed)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164237
    m_Localized: Slightly Used Stars is unhappy again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164236
    m_Localized: They paid. They did not say thank you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164235
    m_Localized: Two ships, one budget. Extra ships do not raise your allowance. This is a feature.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164234
    m_Localized: Halfmoon & Halfmoon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164233
    m_Localized: two identical parcels
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164232
    m_Localized: I sold two runs for the price of one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164228
    m_Localized: Mr. Fink is still waiting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164227
    m_Localized: The tech team says the Wrap can carry more than one ship. They want to try.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164226
    m_Localized: The console stays where it is.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164225
    m_Localized: The ledger is happy. For now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164224
    m_Localized: Mr. Fink's estate says there is nothing else.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610341969945
    m_Localized: The registry is delivered.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610341969944
    m_Localized: The well won. The urn is part of the core now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610341969943
    m_Localized: The field did the work. That is our margin.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610341969942
    m_Localized: Nobody & Co. says the funeral can start on time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610341969941
    m_Localized: The urn is delivered.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610341969940
    m_Localized: The cake went cold. Then stale.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610341969939
    m_Localized: Nobody orders more cake. They just want it cheaper.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610341969938
    m_Localized: The bakery says it is the best they have done.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610341969937
    m_Localized: The cake arrived still warm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610341969936
    m_Localized: Somewhere, Madame Fink just heard a very loud chord.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610341969934
    m_Localized: Madame Fink sent a thank you note. It is mostly complaints.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610341969933
    m_Localized: The piano is delivered.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610341969932
    m_Localized: The bus is part of the asteroid ring now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610341969930
    m_Localized: Strait & Narrow measured it twice.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610341969927
    m_Localized: The bulb is in a solar orbit now. Mark it delivered to the general vicinity.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610341969926
    m_Localized: Fuel for the launch, none after. The ledger is happy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610341969925
    m_Localized: The Keepers say it is the right colour.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610341969924
    m_Localized: The bulb is delivered.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610341969922
    m_Localized: You bend space. Ships get through. The tech team already wants more.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610341969921
    m_Localized: I'm Jim. This is Our Space Corp.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610341969920
    m_Localized: Nice. The ship made it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164256
    m_Localized: The tech team says more are coming.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164257
    m_Localized: Get some sleep.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889881
    m_Localized: Fuel is still capped. Nobody else can do this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889883
    m_Localized: They are back because nobody else is left.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889884
    m_Localized: The last two customers. We keep them happy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889885
    m_Localized: "EPISODE 1 \xB7 THE WRAP"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889886
    m_Localized: "EPISODE 2 \xB7 THE FLEET"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889887
    m_Localized: INITIAL DEPLOYMENT
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889888
    m_Localized: FLEET EXPANSION
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889889
    m_Localized: "Bl\xF6dmeyer & Sons (no sons)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889890
    m_Localized: a pallet of refurbished 2019 copper valves
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889891
    m_Localized: Welcome, new employee. One push at launch, then the field steers. Wrap from any room.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889893
    m_Localized: Launch your next job from the map.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889894
    m_Localized: The brochure calls this synergistic solar harvesting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889895
    m_Localized: It means we skim the sun because fuel costs eight hundred credits a litre.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889896
    m_Localized: The school closed last year. The bus is all that is left.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889897
    m_Localized: The bus is through.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889899
    m_Localized: Madame Fink wants this piano in an orbital lounge.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889900
    m_Localized: The lounge closed yesterday. She paid anyway.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889901
    m_Localized: Move the Wrap. It works everywhere.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889902
    m_Localized: The ledger is happy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889903
    m_Localized: Nobody pays extra anymore. Do not waste it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889904
    m_Localized: The family stopped answering. The contract did not.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889905
    m_Localized: Mr. Fink left the sector one thing. The last birth registry.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889906
    m_Localized: It is mostly empty pages.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889907
    m_Localized: "\u2026Good luck."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889908
    m_Localized: Good news. Clients love our green initiative.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889909
    m_Localized: Bad news. Our green initiative is just me selling two delivery slots on the same entropy budget.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889910
    m_Localized: Try not to tear anything.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889911
    m_Localized: I am not sure who paid for the second.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889912
    m_Localized: Both arrived. Same cost.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889913
    m_Localized: Nobody asked how.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889914
    m_Localized: One of them got lost.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889915
    m_Localized: Slightly Used Stars is back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889916
    m_Localized: They want both cores today. They also want a discount.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889917
    m_Localized: Two halves of a gift. One address.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889918
    m_Localized: They are our last two customers. Let us keep it that way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889919
    m_Localized: The orchestra is in two ships. The animal is in the third.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889920
    m_Localized: Do not ask me which animal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889921
    m_Localized: All three arrived. The opera can begin.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889922
    m_Localized: Three for the price of one. The field came back wrong. Probably nothing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40169889255424
    m_Localized: Fuel for the launch. After that, the field flies it. That is the whole business plan.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40169927004160
    m_Localized: Cheaper than fuel. Much cheaper.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889923
    m_Localized: '> 2048. NOBODY IS BORN. NOTHING GROWS.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889924
    m_Localized: '> FUEL IS CAPPED. EVERY DELIVERY IS A COST.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889925
    m_Localized: '> ONE FIRM FOUND ANOTHER WAY TO SPEND. THE FIELD IS STARTING TO SHOW IT.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889926
    m_Localized: '> THE WRAP WORKS. NOBODY ASKS HOW.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889927
    m_Localized: '> ONE BUDGET NOW CARRIES MORE SHIPS.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72150890864889928
    m_Localized: '> THE BROCHURES CALL IT GREEN. THE FIELD DOES NOT.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164260
    m_Localized: Both dinners arrived. Nobody checked which was which.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164261
    m_Localized: Twin Moons paid twice and called it efficiency.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164262
    m_Localized: One dinner is late. The other is getting cold.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164263
    m_Localized: Two dinners left the same kitchen at once.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164264
    m_Localized: The client wants both at the same time. Through different doors.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164265
    m_Localized: two dinners, one kitchen
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164266
    m_Localized: Twin Moons Catering
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164267
    m_Localized: Two ships, one origin; bend near the start. Out here the star sits at the edge.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164268
    m_Localized: Both cakes arrived. Neither bakery will admit it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164269
    m_Localized: The feud continues, now with better logistics.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164270
    m_Localized: One cake is still in the field. So is the argument.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164271
    m_Localized: The bakeries will not share a van.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164272
    m_Localized: So we are sending two ships and one cube between them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164273
    m_Localized: two cakes, one feud
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164274
    m_Localized: Two Rival Bakeries
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164275
    m_Localized: One cube between two runs. Both ships share the bend; the feud is not our problem.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164276
    m_Localized: All three arrived. The committee counted twice.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164277
    m_Localized: The field came back quiet. I am choosing to like that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164278
    m_Localized: One statue is still out there. They noticed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164279
    m_Localized: Three ships. The committee wants them all at once.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164280
    m_Localized: Fan them out. One Wrap still has to carry all three.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164281
    m_Localized: three commemorative suns
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164282
    m_Localized: The Committee for Three Suns
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164283
    m_Localized: One Wrap carries three ships. Extra ships are a promise, not a budget line.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164284
    m_Localized: Both doors through. The wall is smaller and still load-bearing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164285
    m_Localized: One edit, two clearances. The ledger likes this one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164286
    m_Localized: One door is through. The other is still behind the wall.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164287
    m_Localized: Two deliveries. One wall in the way of both.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164288
    m_Localized: The bureau says the wall is load-bearing. Shrink it anyway.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164289
    m_Localized: two doors, one frame
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164290
    m_Localized: The Bureau of Shared Walls
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164291
    m_Localized: Both runs cross the same blocker. Shrink it once; the budget stays one number.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164292
    m_Localized: Both runs clear. The other planets were innocent.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164293
    m_Localized: The umbrellas are delivered. Still nobody claims them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164294
    m_Localized: That was a decoy. The crate is still behind the real one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164295
    m_Localized: The lost office lost the crate. We found it. Now move it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164296
    m_Localized: Every planet looks guilty. Only one is in the way of both.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164297
    m_Localized: a crate of unclaimed umbrellas
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164298
    m_Localized: The Lost and Found Office
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7610346164299
    m_Localized: A blocker can hide among planets that only look involved. Read the runs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
